[gd_scene load_steps=16 format=3]

; M2-BPR-07: the Drownbell's arena, the Saltgrass Causeway at the ch03_boss sunset (greybox; env-art dresses
; it). Grade from docs/kb/art/color_script.md "Ch3": sun 6 deg over the western sea, key #FFAE67 2.6, fill
; #6E8FC0 0.4, sky #46609A / #F0A35C, fog #D9A27A, exposure 0.80. BattleArena moves this scene's children into
; the battle scene in place of its WorldEnvironment, Sun and Arena; Arena/Sea is the flat sea the flood rig
; replaces. The fight is on the causeway: a stone road along the battle axis with water on both sides.

